Real-world EDID test data
=========================

These EDIDs come from the Linux Hardware EDID repository,
https://github.com/linuxhw/EDID, collected by linux-hardware.org users and
published under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes from the originals: only the first hex dump of each file is kept, the
base block serial number is zeroed, serial number text descriptors read
"SERIAL", serial-like strings in DisplayID vendor data are replaced with
'0' characters, and the affected checksums are recomputed.

Conformant EDIDs must parse, reassemble to identical bytes, and reparse.
Non-conformant EDIDs must be rejected by default and open with EDID errors
ignored.

Conformant:

  tcl-tcl0000.hex                Digital/TCL/TCL0000/3FC9396BD4D7
  au-optronics-auofcb7.hex       Digital/AU Optronics/AUOFCB7/972539E1EB4E
